OL,3,GNEWSASerious car accident shuts M5 in
OL,4,AWorcestershire
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe M5 motorway is shut northbound in
OL,7,FWorcestershire between junction five
OL,8,Fand junction 4a following a two-car
OL,9,Faccident that left a male driver with
OL,10,F"serious life-changing injuries",
OL,11,Fpolice said.
OL,13,FThe route was closed in both directions
OL,14,Fat about 04:00 GMT on Saturday between
OL,15,Fthe Droitwich and M42 turnoffs,
OL,16,FNational Highways said.
OL,18,FThe southbound route reopened shortly
OL,19,Fafter 06:00, but the northbound
OL,20,Fcarriageway remains closed for accident
OL,21,Finvestigation work.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
