OL,3,GNEWSASerious car accident shuts M5 in
OL,4,AWorcestershire
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Mercia Police has appealed for
OL,7,Fwitnesses to the crash, which involved
OL,8,Fan Audi SQ5 and a Volkswagen Scirocco
OL,9,Fand left the Audi driver, a man in his
OL,10,F50s, seriously hurt.
